  "slug": "designer-notes",
  "name": "Designer Notes",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Pin comments in the browser, just like you would in your favourite design tools—then hand off to Claude Code to apply the changes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `designer-notes` (Wire designer-notes into the current project — adds the script tag, starts the dev server, and opens in…), `submit-feedback` (Read a UI feedback markdown file exported by designer-notes and apply targeted code revisions).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install designer-notes@claude-community` from `arturnbull/designer-notes`.",
